{"title":"Career Roadmap · Financial Analyst","role":"Financial Analyst","summary":"A Financial Analyst analyses financial data to support decisions involving budgeting, forecasting, profitability, investments, business performance and resource allocation.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)","Course":"B.Com – Accounting & Finance"},"about":[{"label":"Alignment","text":"Very Strong"},{"label":"Typical Entry Level","text":"Financial Analyst / Junior Financial Analyst / Finance Analyst / FP&A Analyst"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Financial Analyst analyses financial data to support decisions involving budgeting, forecasting, profitability, investments, business performance and resource allocation."},{"type":"p","text":"B.Com Accounting & Finance is one of the strongest undergraduate routes into this career because it provides a foundation in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accounting"},{"text":"Financial management"},{"text":"Corporate finance"},{"text":"Taxation"},{"text":"Business economics"},{"text":"Financial reporting"},{"text":"Cost accounting"},{"text":"Business law"}]},{"type":"p","text":"However, the degree alone is not enough. Employers typically expect strong Excel, financial modelling, accounting analysis and business communication skills."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizon","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Role","Main Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Finance Intern"},{"text":"Accounting & finance fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Finance/Accounting Intern"},{"text":"Financial analysis"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"FP&A/Finance Intern"},{"text":"Modelling & reporting"}],[{"text":"Graduation"},{"text":"Junior Financial Analyst"},{"text":"Reporting & analysis"}],[{"text":"2–4 Years"},{"text":"Financial Analyst"},{"text":"Forecasting & decision support"}],[{"text":"4–7 Years"},{"text":"Senior Financial Analyst"},{"text":"Advanced modelling"}],[{"text":"7–10 Years"},{"text":"Finance Manager / FP&A Manager"},{"text":"Business planning"}],[{"text":"10+ Years"},{"text":"Finance Director / Controller / CFO Track"},{"text":"Strategic finance"}]]}]},{"heading":"What Does a Financial Analyst Do?","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Financial Analyst may work on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial statements"},{"text":"Budgeting"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Revenue analysis"},{"text":"Cost analysis"},{"text":"Profitability analysis"},{"text":"Variance analysis"},{"text":"Cash-flow analysis"},{"text":"Financial modelling"},{"text":"Business performance reporting"},{"text":"Investment analysis"},{"text":"Valuation"},{"text":"Management reporting"},{"text":"Scenario analysis"},{"text":"Strategic decision support"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact role depends on the organisation."},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"p","text":"Corporate Finance Analyst → analyses company performance."},{"type":"p","text":"FP&A Analyst → focuses on budgets, forecasts and business planning."},{"type":"p","text":"Investment Analyst → analyses companies, securities and investments."},{"type":"p","text":"Credit Analyst → evaluates borrowers and credit risk."},{"type":"p","text":"Equity Research Analyst → analyses companies and securities for investment decisions."}]},{"heading":"Build Skills During B.Com","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Accounting & Finance Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"h","text":"Accounting"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Journal entries"},{"text":"Ledgers"},{"text":"Trial balance"},{"text":"Profit & loss statement"},{"text":"Balance sheet"},{"text":"Cash-flow statement"},{"text":"Depreciation"},{"text":"Working capital"},{"text":"Financial ratios"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Finance"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Time value of money"},{"text":"Interest rates"},{"t